> Converted from personal notes. Amounts are for one serving. Directions are editorial, not verified source instructions.

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @ground beef{3/10%lb}, @gluten-free corn taco shells{12/5}, @gluten-free taco seasoning{2/5%tbsp}, @water{1/10%cup}, @lettuce{2/5%cup} (shredded), @cheddar{3/10%cup} (shredded), @tomatoes{2/5} (diced), @sour cream{1/10%cup}, @gluten-free salsa{3/20%cup}, @?avocado{1/5} (diced).

== Preparation ==

Brown ground beef, stir in gluten-free taco seasoning and water, and simmer until coated. Warm taco shells according to their package. Fill with beef, lettuce, cheddar and tomato; serve with sour cream, salsa and optional avocado.
